Great! (BTW, what is the University's privacy policy with regard to
the physical domain?)


>Violating reasonable use of computer resources may result in
>permanent termination of access to the Department's computing
>facility.
[...]
>In a situation in which a possible violation has been detected, the
>evidence will be taken to the Chair of the Computer Committee or the
