a problem comes up. Rules that have to be selectively enforced are bad rules.
Also there is the enforcement problem. We have users here who are capable of
getting compiling and useing graphics display software from thier own 
accounts. Since you din't have any real interest in stopping this, I suspect
that you would let it go until a problem comes up.
